arn about.\n\nIMPACT: the public catalog is a documented consumer surface; a consumer walking the tree silently gets 36%\nof the classes, and the SPA presents it as complete.","fix_direction":"Serve a bounded or paginated tree with an explicit signal: a `total` field, a `truncated`/`next` marker,\nor real pagination \u2014 and document the window. Raise/compress the payload only as far as the real catalog\nneeds (9.8 MB for 2785 classes scales to ~50 MB at a 14k-class catalog). Acceptance: a consumer can tell\nwhether the tree is complete (total == stats.total_problems) or page through it, and the Explore UI either\nrenders every class or names the truncation on screen. Also: when the run log says a finding was filed,\nverify the id exists on the board before the next run inherits it.","capability_tags":["api","ui","docs","process","dogfood"],"created_by":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20T11:13:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:21:00Z","worker_status":"pass","attempts":0,"exit_code":null,"commit_hash":"92904d16d38b6500ef87e3d8895f06f5791a8b04","files_changed":[],"lines_added":0,"lines_removed":0,"guard_result":"PASS","ci_result":"SKIP","worker_summary":"Worker gpt-6-luna@openai-codex (session 20261021_095654_00f22b, isolated worktree wt/DF-OFF-BY-ONE-53-R2) implemented clamped limit/offset + total/limit/offset/truncated envelope on GET /api/v1/taxonomy (internal/api/handlers.go), 6-case regression test TestTaxonomy_PaginationWindow (internal/api/handlers_test.go), docs (api-reference.md param table + paged example, integration.md note), and Explore UI truncation notice 'Showing X of N problem classes.' + Load-more paging (web/js/explore.js). Commits: 92904d16 (implementation) + 2d787968 (chore(trace) binding marker to 92904d16) + merge 49670736 into master. Foreman merge gate: stale-base OK (branch base == master HEAD c99d0bdf), go build/vet clean, go test ./... -count=1 16 pkgs ok on merged tree, marker greppable at HEAD. Tier-2 judge PASS (dir 1a27b82f, verdict id 2718